[openart][target][stderr]  # Internal API Client
[openart][target][stderr]  
[openart][target][stderr] -This repo provides a client to interact with our internal APIs for demonstration purposes.
[openart][target][stderr] \ No newline at end of file
[openart][target][stderr] +This Python client provides a simple interface to connect to The Agent Company's internal API.
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +## Features
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +- Easy authentication with API key
[openart][target][stderr] +- Simple HTTP requests to internal endpoints
[openart][target][stderr] +- Error handling for common API responses
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +## Usage
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +```python
[openart][target][stderr] +from client import InternalAPIClient
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +# Initialize the client with your API key
[openart][target][stderr] +client = InternalAPIClient(api_key="your-api-key-here")
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +# Make API calls
[openart][target][stderr] +response = client.get_data()
[openart][target][stderr] +print(response)
[openart][target][stderr] +```
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +## API Endpoints
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +The client currently supports:
[openart][target][stderr] +- `GET /v1/data` - Retrieve data from the internal API
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +## Installation
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +```bash
[openart][target][stderr] +pip install requests
[openart][target][stderr] +```
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +## Configuration
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +Set your API key in the `client.py` file or pass it as a parameter when initializing the client.
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +## License
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +Internal use only.
